      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَيْلَمَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلَمٌ</span>, in three places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Accord. to
IAar, (T,) <i>A sound,</i> or <i>voice.</i> (T, K.) You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا سَمِعْتُ لَهُ أَيْلَمَةٌ</span> <i>I heard not any sound,</i> or
<i>voice, of,</i> or <i>belonging to, him,</i> or <i>it.</i> (IAar, T.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Accord. to AA, (T,) <i>Motion.</i> (T, K.)

